      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04425048828125,
        120.30829620361328,
        513.0347900390625,
        134.7512969970703
      ],
      "text": "evaluation or according to national guidelines should be given TB preventive treatment even if",
