        78.04428100585938,
        278.76678466796875,
        500.18914794921875,
        293.2098083496094
      ],
      "text": "8. Systematic testing and treatment for TB infection may be considered for prisoners, health",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04426574707031,
        290.76678466796875,
        508.3464660644531,
        305.2098083496094
      ],
      "text": "workers, immigrants from countries with a high TB burden, homeless people and people who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04425048828125,
        302.76678466796875,
        128.32525634765625,
        317.2098083496094
      ],
      "text": "use drugs.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        324.1173400878906,
        299.7525634765625,
        338.6263122558594
      ],
      "text": "1.2. TB screening and ruling out TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        345.9960021972656,
        500.7591552734375,
        360.43902587890625
      ],
      "text": "9. Infants and children living with HIV who have poor weight gain, fever or current cough or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.0442886352539,
        357.9960021972656,
        492.7559814453125,
        372.43902587890625
      ],
      "text": "who have a history of contact with a person with TB should be evaluated for TB and other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04428100585938,
        369.9960021972656,
        486.9664306640625,
        384.43902587890625
      ],
      "text": "diseases that cause such symptoms. If TB disease is excluded after an appropriate clinical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04427337646484,
        381.9960021972656,
        509.11871337890625,
        396.43902587890625
      ],
      "text": "evaluation or according to national guidelines, these children should be offered TB preventive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04428100585938,
        393.9960021972656,
        235.81072998046875,
        408.43902587890625
      ],
      "text": "treatment, regardless of their age.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04428100585938,
        415.6105651855469,
        497.48919677734375,
        430.0535888671875
      ],
      "text": "10. Adults and adolescents living with HIV should be screened for TB according to a clinical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04428100585938,
        427.6105651855469,
        507.5625305175781,
        442.0535888671875
      ],
      "text": "algorithm. Those who do not report any of the symptoms of current cough, fever, weight loss",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04428100585938,
        439.6105651855469,
        512.0698852539062,
        454.0535888671875
      ],
      "text": "or night sweats are unlikely to have TB disease. Those who report any of these symptoms may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        451.6105651855469,
        490.8100280761719,
        466.0535888671875
      ],
      "text": "have TB, should be evaluated for TB disease and other diseases and should be offered TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.0443115234375,
        463.6105651855469,
        513.6497192382812,
        478.0536193847656
      ],
      "text": "preventive treatment if TB disease is excluded, regardless of their antiretroviral treatment status.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.0443115234375,
        485.22515869140625,
        486.0262451171875,
        499.6681823730469
      ],
      "text": "11. Among adults and adolescents living with HIV, chest X-ray may be used to screen for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.0443115234375,
        497.22515869140625,
        128.6013946533203,
        511.6682434082031
      ],
      "text": "TB disease.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        518.8397827148438,
        504.502197265625,
        533.2827758789062
      ],
      "text": "12. Among adults and adolescents living with HIV, C-reactive protein at a cut-off of > 5 mg/L",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.0443115234375,
        530.8397827148438,
        251.5565185546875,
        545.2828369140625
      ],
      "text": "may be used to screen for TB disease.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04426574707031,
        552.454345703125,
        483.81622314453125,
        566.8973388671875
      ],
      "text": "13. Among adults and adolescents living with HIV, molecular WHO-recommended rapid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04426574707031,
        564.454345703125,
        324.9524841308594,
        578.8973999023438
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic tests may be used to screen for TB disease.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.0443115234375,
        586.0689697265625,
        480.8837890625,
        600.511962890625
      ],
      "text": "14. Among HIV-negative household contacts aged ≥ 5 years and other risk groups, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.0443115234375,
        598.0689697265625,
        514.0283813476562,
        612.511962890625
      ],
      "text": "absence of any symptoms of TB and the absence of abnormal chest radiographic findings may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.0443115234375,
        610.0689697265625,
        365.17987060546875,
        624.511962890625
      ],
      "text": "be used to rule out TB disease before TB preventive treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04426574707031,
        631.68359375,
        513.1860961914062,
        646.1265869140625
      ],
      "text": "15. Among individuals aged ≥ 15 years in populations in which TB screening is recommended,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04421997070312,
        643.68359375,
        509.7922668457031,
        658.1265869140625
      ],
      "text": "systematic screening for TB disease may be conducted with a symptom screen, chest X-ray or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04421997070312,
        655.68359375,
        441.2707824707031,
        670.1265869140625
      ],
      "text": "molecular WHO-recommended rapid diagnostic tests, alone or in combination.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.0443115234375,
        677.2981567382812,
        485.83087158203125,
        691.7411499023438
      ],
      "text": "16. Among individuals < 15 years who are close contacts of a person with TB, systematic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.0443115234375,
        689.2982177734375,
        499.20037841796875,
        703.7412109375
      ],
      "text": "screening for TB disease should be conducted with a symptom screen of any one of cough,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.0443115234375,
        701.2982177734375,
        341.36505126953125,
        715.7412109375
      ],
      "text": "fever or poor weight gain; or chest radiography; or both.",
